{"id":"u_bel","lemma":"übel","pos":"adj","rank":950,"glosses":["bad, evil, terrible (not good, in quality or morality)","unwell, sick, queasy, nauseous"],"ipa":"/ˈyːbəl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0a/De-%C3%BCbel.ogg/De-%C3%BCbel.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"übler","superlative":"am übelsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Es riecht übel.","en":"It smells bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/81344","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to smell","l":"riechen"},null]},{"text":"Sie riechen übel.","en":"They smell bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77605","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to smell"},null]},{"text":"Ich nehme es dir nicht übel.","en":"I don't blame you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/789478","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Du musst wohl oder übel gehen.","en":"Like it or not, you have to go.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"possibly, probably"},{"g":"or"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Das ist auch nicht übel.","en":"That's not bad, either.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"also"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}